flowchart TB
    Scene[Scenes / serialized references] --> Flow[BoatLevelFlow]
    Input[BoatInput] -->|lane step callback| Flow
    Flow -->|direct calls| Boat[BoatController]
    Boat -->|collision callbacks| Flow
    Flow --> Bus[EventBus]
    Boat --> Bus
    BoatUI[BoatLevelUI] -->|flow methods via Service| Flow
    BoatUI <--> Bus
    Bus --> Audio[AudioService]
    Bus --> VFX[BoatLevelVfx]
    Bus --> Voice[VoiceActivityEvent]
    Voice --> Character[CharacterExpressions]
    Nile[NilometerUI] --> Water[WaterOperator / WaterAnimator]
    Nile --> Dialogue[Shared DialoguePanel]
    Player[Player / avatar selection] --> SaveManager[SaveManager]
    SaveManager --> SaveSystem[SaveSystem]
    SaveSystem --> File[player.save]
